== Effects ==
* {{dlc|nr}} Grants [[homing tears]] for the current room.
* {{dlc+|r}} Grants [[homing tears]] and +3 [[Range]] for the current room.{{dlc-}}

== Notes ==
* '''I - The Magician''' has the same effect as {{i|Telepathy For Dummies}}, as evidenced by the given costume.

== Strategy ==
* Since this effect only lasts for a room, it is preferably used against a boss. Homing allows to focus more on dodging.

== Synergies ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth|r}}: Gives {{i|The Book of Belial}} effect on top of homing.
** {{I|Tarot Cloth|r}} + {{i|Blank Card}} + {{i|Car Battery|n}} : Only damage is doubled.

== Interactions ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth|nr}}: No effect.

== Unlockable [[Achievement]]s ==
{{achievement text | Baby-Bender      }}
** {{dlc|nr}} Using '''I - The Magician''' with {{I|Tarot Cloth}} unlocks Baby-bender.
*** {{dlc|r}} Now having a special effect, '''I - The Magician''' no longer contributes twice to Baby-bender's unlock condition.

== Trivia ==
* [[wikipedia:The Magician (tarot card)|The Magician]] is the first card of a Major Arcana set.

